<rml>
<head>
	<!-- The dragon soul refine window (uidragonsoul.py DragonSoulRefineWindow,
	     uiscript dragonsoulrefinewindow.py; P15 spec 6). While the
	     dragon-soul-refine flag is on, the Interface makes
	     nui_dragon_soul_refine.DragonSoulRefineWindow (controller
	     assets/root/nui_dragon_soul_refine.py), a subclass of the legacy class
	     whose widgets are proxies: the three modes, the recipes and their
	     checks, the popups, the counts, the refine packet and the result are
	     legacy's code, and this document shows what legacy tells the
	     proxies. It exists only while the window shows (nui_hud.OnDemand).
	     In legacy's order: the material cells (DRAGON_SOUL_REFINE_CELLS: the
	     placed items, the recipe's ghosts, and the closed cells at or past
	     the recipe's count) and the result cells, the mode choices, the fee
	     and the refine button.
	     Cell events reach the legacy handlers through nui_slots.LegacySlotEvents:
	     an item is dragged in from the inventory or the dragon soul window
	     (either UI's) through the legacy mouse controller. The body and its
	     controls take no focus, so controls act on a left mousedown. It draws
	     below the legacy UI layer, as legacy's window lived in it. A left or
	     right press anywhere on it raises the window (board_press). Classic's
	     art (the board's picture, the closed cells' cap, the buttons') is its
	     overlay's. -->
	<title>dragon-soul-refine</title>
	<link type="text/template" href="../../nui.rtpl"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="dragon-soul-refine.rcss"/>
</head>
<body template="nui" id="dragon-soul-refine" class="nui-window nui-fx nui-anim nui-below-legacy-ui dsr" data-model="ds_refine"
      data-event-mousedown="board_press(ev.button)" data-class-dsr--placed="placed">
	<div class="dsr-bg"></div>
	<div class="nui-window__titlebar dsr__titlebar">
		<span class="dsr-title-icon"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--gem"><span class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span
			class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></span>
		<handle id="dsr-title" class="nui-window__handle dsr__handle" move_target="#document">
			<span class="nui-window__title dsr__title">@ui.DRAGONSOUL_REFINE_WINDOW_TITLE</span>
		</handle>
		<button id="dsr-close" class="nui-button nui-button--ghost nui-button--icon nui-window__close nui-anim dsr__close"
		        data-event-mousedown="close_press(ev.button)"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--close"><span
			class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></button>
	</div>
	<div class="nui-window__body dsr__body">
		<div class="dsr-main">
			<div id="dsr-cells" class="nui-slot-grid dsr-cells" data-class-nui-attach-right="attach_right"
			     data-class-nui-slot-grid--cols-5="cells_cols == 5">
				<div class="nui-slot nui-anim dsr-cell" data-for="c : cells" data-attr-id="'dsr-cell-' + it_index"
				     data-class-is-empty="c.kind == ''" data-class-is-closed="c.closed" data-class-is-ghost="c.ghost"
				     data-class-is-target="c.target == 'move'" data-class-is-blocked="c.target == 'blocked'"
				     data-event-mousedown="cell_press(it_index, ev.button)" data-event-mouseup="cell_release(it_index, ev.button)"
				     data-event-dblclick="cell_use(it_index)" data-event-mouseover="cell_over(it_index)"
				     data-event-mouseout="cell_out(it_index)" data-event-nuidrop="cell_drop(it_index)">
					<img class="nui-slot__icon" data-if="c.icon != ''" data-attr-src="c.icon"/>
					<nui-number class="nui-slot__number" data-if="c.count != ''" data-attr-value="c.count"/>
					<span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--lock" data-if="c.closed"><span class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span
						class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="dsr-arrow"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--chevron-right"><span class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span
				class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--chevron-right"><span
				class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span></div>
			<div id="dsr-result" class="nui-slot-grid dsr-result" data-class-nui-attach-right="attach_right"
			     data-class-nui-slot-grid--cols-2="result_cols == 2">
				<div class="nui-slot nui-anim dsr-result-cell" data-for="c : result" data-attr-id="'dsr-result-' + it_index"
				     data-class-is-empty="c.kind == ''"
				     data-class-is-target="c.target == 'move'" data-class-is-blocked="c.target == 'blocked'"
				     data-event-mouseover="result_over(it_index)" data-event-mouseout="result_out(it_index)">
					<img class="nui-slot__icon" data-if="c.icon != ''" data-attr-src="c.icon"/>
					<nui-number class="nui-slot__number" data-if="c.count != ''" data-attr-value="c.count"/>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="dsr-modes">
			<div class="dsr-mode-place" data-for="m : modes" data-attr-class="'dsr-mode-place dsr-mode-place--' + m.name">
				<button class="nui-button nui-anim dsr-mode" data-attr-id="'dsr-mode-' + m.name" data-class-is-selected="m.down"
				        data-event-mousedown="mode_press(m.name, ev.button)"><span class="dsr-mode__label">{{ m.label }}</span></button>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="dsr-foot">
			<div id="dsr-fee" class="dsr-fee"><span class="nui-glyph nui-glyph--coin dsr-fee__coin"><span
				class="nui-glyph__a"></span><span class="nui-glyph__b"></span></span><span
				class="dsr-fee__amount">{{ fee }}</span></div>
			<button id="dsr-refine" class="nui-button nui-button--primary nui-anim dsr-refine"
			        data-event-mousedown="refine_press(ev.button)"><span class="dsr-refine__label">@ui.DO_REFINE</span></button>
		</div>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
